{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1066009/block/singleImage/3279608/wm/01M8C6EQA26T2DJENECHH5557G.jpg?updatedAt=1795705957\"/><figcaption>瀚澄首推12伙 下周一起招標發售 | 鴨脷洲新盤</figcaption></figure><p>由SC Capital Partners發展的鴨脷洲新盤「瀚澄」剛公佈首份銷售安排，落實於下周一（30日）起以招標形式推售12個單位，分別為6、9及18樓全層A至D室，實用面積介乎224至401方呎，屬開放式至2房間隔。 「瀚澄」位處鴨脷洲平瀾街2號，屬單幢式設計，全盤僅提供82伙，涵蓋開放式至2房間隔，主打一房及兩房戶型，實用面積由186至503平方呎，預計關鍵日期為2027年6月30日。 即睇鴨脷洲「瀚澄」最新資訊(House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:44:22.437712+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":246,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T15:12:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T10:37:21.299222+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T16:37:36.766223+00:00","content_hash":"803a8c724bc90001390602a560ee683de789b2cbfc358c4405623333b281bcb7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:44:22.437712+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}